// Ch11 B09 "Nhoa" (C, 4 min). act2_ch11.md §2 B09. N02: from the dry ledge (design default (a): walked, the
// sanctum seen underwater), Nhoa standing in the water as if in air: a Kirru-like figure of held motes like
// silt, antlers of mangrove root, bound light, perfectly still. NOTHING FROZEN (rule 1). N03: Pell stops at
// the back of the line; his crest goes all the way up; he hums the storm's note softly and stops himself.
// N04: the carved name-shell at her throat (the player's only cue); Pell's own is blank. N05: Pell speaks
// his four sentences, kneels in the water at the ledge's edge, and from here SAYS NOTHING (rule 4).
// N07: the binding: Asha sings the verses she has; the fourth verse comes up out of the water to her
// (`nhoa_bound`: a Kirru voice, very old and very young; no words are written here, Audio's Lamptongue);
// the silt-light rises into her verse-sleeve, now S4. N08: Nhoa's head turns, once, toward Pell (a turn
// only; bound light can't change its expression). N09: Pell still kneeling; Kerrid stays on the ledge
// behind him without a word until he stands.
title: ch11_nhoa
location: ch11/lowlight
---
@letterbox on
// M4-CIN-1304 (cinematics): staged from act2_ch11_direction.md (shots and marks in game/data/cutscene/ch11/).
@mark pell pell_back walk
@mark asha asha_ledge walk
@camera N02
@music lowlight fade=2.0
@vfx glimmer_bound at=nhoa count=1
@wait 4.0
@camera N03
@anim pell stop
@anim pell crest_up
@sfx pell_storm_note at=pell vol=0.3
@wait 2.5
@camera N04
@wait 2.5
@camera N05
@mark pell pell_kneel walk
@wait 1.5
Pell [grief]: She is here. She is not lifted. Do not speak yet. Please. #line:ch11_nhoa_001 #tn:"'Lifted': the Kirru word for the dead who have gone up. Pell speaks of his sister."
@anim pell kneel
@wait 7.0
@camera N06
@anim asha look_at pell
@wait 2.0
@anim asha look_at nhoa
@wait 2.0
@camera N07
@anim asha raise_staff
@music nhoa_bound fade=0.0
@wait 8.0
@vfx glimmer_bound at=asha count=4
@wait 3.0
@camera N08
@anim nhoa turn_head pell
@wait 3.0
@camera N09
@mark kerrid ledge_behind_pell walk
@wait 8.0
<<set $ch11_nhoa_bound = true>>
<<set $ch11_pell_knelt = true>>
@music lowlight fade=2.0
@letterbox off
@camera release
===
